      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh so this ia called sanitization… I think this sanitization is unnecessary everywhere, not only at note but also at bio. Why they don't just support all Unicode characters?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-05T12:15:51.780Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The sanitization that is done in user profiles and world descriptions is also applied to Notes that can only be viewed privately.\n\nHowever, I think this sanitization is unnecessary because no one can see the Note except you.\n\nBecause of this sanitization, URLs no longer work, emojis and arrows are removed without any sound, line breaks are lost, \"mishit\" becomes \"mipoop\", and all hell breaks loose.\n\nユーザープロフィールやワールドの説明において行われているサニタイズが個人的にしか見られないNoteにも適用されています。\n\nしかし自分以外の人はNoteを見ることが出来ないため、このサニタイズは不要だと思います。\n\nこのサニタイズのせいでURLは機能しなくなり、絵文字・矢印は削除され、改行も失われ、\"mishit\"は\"mipoop\"になります。",
